      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Since your colors are coming out faded and not transferring, the issue might be with the heat or pressure application rather than just the settings. Focus on ensuring your temperature is at the manufacturer's recommended point and that you are maintaining consistent, firm pressure across the entire design. Also, check that your sublimation paper is not wrinkled or damp, as this can severely inhibit the transfer process.",
